 both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2kw & =8w+6 \\\\ 2kw-8w & =8w+6-8w \\\\ 2kw-8w & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we factor $w$ on the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n(2k-8)w=6.\n$$\n\nNotice that this equation is now in the form $aw=b:$\n\n$$\n{{(2k-8)}_{⏟}}_{a}w={{6}_{⏟}}_{b}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\n2k-8=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $k,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2k-8 & =0 \\\\ 2k-8+8 & =0+8 \\\\ 2k & =8 \\\\ \\frac{2k}{2} & =\\frac{8}{2} \\\\ k & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["63b9655a-da4a-564d-bafe-9eef888349c0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "351c6760-2d41-5642-92d7-567cdbea9eba" :answer/id #uuid "351c6760-2d41-5642-92d7-567cdbea9eba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9e037d3d-08fd-5885-a18a-b711b1abd7f3" :answer/id #uuid "9e037d3d-08fd-5885-a18a-b711b1abd7f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "83cb3993-2d74-5020-9b3b-d5e366dd38a1" :answer/id #uuid "83cb3993-2d74-5020-9b3b-d5e366dd38a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1f7c83f2-5ad9-542c-a627-09cdb3781d8a" :answer/id #uuid "1f7c83f2-5ad9-542c-a627-09cdb3781d8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{7}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "086ce183-4353-5a8e-94de-03506b202c6a" :answer/id #uuid "086ce183-4353-5a8e-94de-03506b202c6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "005aa8bf-3c7d-5585-8a50-02663f31f95a" :answer-field/id #uuid "005aa8bf-3c7d-5585-8a50-02663f31f95a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["351c6760-2d41-5642-92d7-567cdbea9eba" "9e037d3d-08fd-5885-a18a-b711b1abd7f3" "83cb3993-2d74-5020-9b3b-d5e366dd38a1" "1f7c83f2-5ad9-542c-a627-09cdb3781d8a" "086ce183-4353-